description	"The Brawler

This Brawler, based on the open mode Wookiee class, forgoes any ranged weaponry to become the most ferocious melee fighter imaginable.

^2Weaponry:
- Wookiee Claws
- Dual Vibroblades
-- ^2Dual ^7Style Only
-- Sword Defense (1)

^5Powers:
- Jump (1)
- Speed (2)

^8Attributes:
- Wookiee Strength (3)
- Heal (3)
- CTF: 40s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Wookiee Fury (1) ^3[CS1 Melee]
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS2 Melee]

^2Strengths^7: Excellent protection and deadly melee attacks.
^1Weaknesses^7: Ineffective outside of melee range."